dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.model.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.model.diff
; `SemioModelDiff::encode_diff`/`decode_diff` (🔺️diff/🦀️component.rs §TopLevel) -- deliberately NO
; envelope framing (unlike the snapshot facet): the binary form is just the `print_diff()` text
; bytes verbatim, same simplification GifDiff/SvgDiff/BcfDiff all use.
start frame
segment line_utf8_bytes eos bytes
; line_utf8_bytes decodes as UTF-8 text matching ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio's `line`
; production -- there is no separate binary layout to describe beyond "it's the text bytes".
